{
    "title": "RX Lead Manager (Emperia)",
    "description": "Lead Manager App (formerly Emperia) is a simple app for exhibitors to use at an event to digitally collect leads \u2013 exclusive to RX.\r\n\r\nWorks Offline: All leads are saved to your device and synchronised when an internet connection is available\r\n \r\nQualify Your Leads: Add ratings and notes to your leads to enable efficient follow-up after the show\r\n\r\nExport Anytime: Create a report of all of your leads at any time using the personal link emailed to you\r\n\r\nMultiple Users: Have multiple users associated with your organisation with no additional cost\r\n\r\nQR Codes: Supports both encrypted and unencrypted QR codes.\r\n\r\nSimple and Lightweight: Won't drain your battery\r\n\r\n\r\nAttending a RX event? Please contact your show team for an access code.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Lead Manager App (formerly Emperia) is a simple app for exhibitors to use at an event to digitally collect leads \u2013 exclusive to RX.<br><br>Works Offline: All leads are saved to your device and synchronised when an internet connection is available<br> <br>Qualify Your Leads: Add ratings and notes to your leads to enable efficient follow-up after the show<br><br>Export Anytime: Create a report of all of your leads at any time using the personal link emailed to you<br><br>Multiple Users: Have multiple users associated with your organisation with no additional cost<br><br>QR Codes: Supports both encrypted and unencrypted QR codes.<br><br>Simple and Lightweight: Won&#39;t drain your battery<br><br><br>Attending a RX event? Please contact your show team for an access code.",
